msgstr "``/health``\\ 、\\ ``/ready``\\ 、\\ ``/metrics``\\ のための別のリスナーのアドレス。"

#: ../../operations.rst:1608
msgid "``trusted_proxies`` on an ``http`` or ``tcp`` frontend"
msgstr "``http``\\ または\\ ``tcp``\\ のフロントエンドの\\ ``trusted_proxies``"

#: ../../operations.rst:1609
msgid "``[]``"
msgstr "``[]``"

#: ../../operations.rst:1610
msgid ""
"The networks of the proxies in front of this frontend. At most 64. A "
